            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nI did not see this in the wild and could not reproduce with 'pyright'. I guess this might happen if LSP server returns empty result.\r\n\r\nWould you mind checking if adjusting [this line](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c333187fcc76d7e772dac32c2a440a949fe34be4/lua/mini/completion.lua#L1261) to have `return math.max(height, 1), math.max(width, 1)` solves the issue?",
